	"ambience": {
		"_note": "base_loop, by_weather[look weather] and by_variant[look id] are each a list of loop ids; a look starts all of them once (an id in two lists starts once). The base is a light wind in every look; dusk adds birds and a far, quiet crowd murmur (OQ-AUDIO-CROWD: a new creative choice for Shibi to keep, change or drop); rain adds rain and a stronger wind; night adds crickets. The two thunder takes are cut from one long thunder recorded over rain (the rain under it is about 20 dB below the clap) and play non-positionally while the rain bed runs. Braziers crackle from a real fireplace recording. Whether each loop's seam is click-free cannot be proven headless ([unknown], listen on the device). First mix for Shibi, placeholder (OQ-AUDIO-MIX).",
